<tt xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml-internal" xmlns:amll="http://www.example.com/ns/amll" itunes:timing="Line" xml:lang="ja-JP"><head><metadata><ttm:agent type="person" xml:id="v1"/><amll:meta key="ncmMusicId" value="1872428447"/><amll:meta key="appleMusicId" value="1582625744"/><amll:meta key="musicName" value="蒼に躊躇う"/><amll:meta key="artists" value="花鋏キョウ"/><amll:meta key="album" value="Petrichor"/><amll:meta key="ttmlAuthorGithub" value="149807805"/><amll:meta key="ttmlAuthorGithubLogin" value="Ma-hiru"/></metadata></head><body dur="03:15.326"><div begin="00:12.418" end="02:46.669"><p begin="00:12.418" end="00:13.953" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L1">まだ立ち去っていないの<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">你还没走吗</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ma da ta chi sa 't te i na i no</span></p><p begin="00:14.585" end="00:15.785" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L2">手に入らないんだから<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">因为你得不到</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">te ni ha i ra na i n da ka ra</span></p><p begin="00:16.689" end="00:19.902" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L3">この上なく特別な罪だ 愛だ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">最特别的罪 爱</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ko no u e na ku to ku be tsu na tsu mi da a i da</span></p><p begin="00:20.969" end="00:22.151" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L4">読み取っていたのは<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我读到的是</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">yo mi to 't te i ta no ha</span></p><p begin="00:22.869" end="00:23.902" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L5">からっぽの心<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">空虚的心</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ka ra 'p po no ko ko ro</span></p><p begin="00:24.131" end="00:28.270" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L6">いつまでも隠してはおけないだろう<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">总不能一直</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ka ra 'p po no ko ko ro</span></p><p begin="00:28.722" end="00:31.770" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L7">まあ大体これ位だ<span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">o ke na i da ro u</span></p><p begin="00:31.852" end="00:33.852" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L8">皮膚を刺すような感覚<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">刺痛皮肤的感觉</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">hi fu wo sa su yo u na ka n ka ku</span></p><p begin="00:34.420" end="00:37.353" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L9">美しく重なるダンス<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">美丽重叠的舞蹈</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">u tsu ku shi ku ka sa na ru da n su</span></p><p begin="00:38.736" end="00:40.185" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L10">変わりなく思ってるよ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我还是这么想的</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ka wa ri na ku o mo 't te ru yo</span></p><p begin="00:40.803" end="00:42.103" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L11">何処だって裏面があるし<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">到处都有另一面</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">do ko da 't te ri me n ga a ru shi</span></p><p begin="00:42.888" end="00:44.104" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L12">そう容易くは無いよ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">可没那么容易</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">so u ta ya su ku ha na i yo</span></p><p begin="00:45.285" end="00:46.351" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L13">振り切って乗っかって<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">甩开他们 乘胜追击</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">fu ri ki 't te no 'k ka 't te</span></p><p begin="00:47.170" end="00:48.237" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L14">上手く惑わせて<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">让他迷惑</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">u ma ku ma do wa se te</span></p><p begin="00:49.385" end="00:50.485" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L15">心鳴らす音<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">心灵的呼唤</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ko ko ro na ra su o to</span></p><p begin="00:51.318" end="00:53.069" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L16">真っ盛り伝えよう<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">尽情地传达吧</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ma 's sa ka ri tsu ta e yo u</span></p><p begin="00:53.901" end="00:54.768" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L17">蒼に躊躇う橙<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">苍灯踌躇</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">a o ni ta me ra u hi</span></p><p begin="00:55.751" end="00:56.785" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L18">惜しみなくもたらす<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">不惜一切代价</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">o shi mi na ku mo ta ra su</span></p><p begin="00:57.761" end="01:01.318" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L19">覆いを溶かすほど消えてしまうよ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">它会消失得几乎融化覆盖层</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">o o i wo to ka su ho do ki e te shi ma u yo</span></p><p begin="01:01.360" end="01:04.736" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L20">実を焦がしても<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">即便身心俱焚</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">mi wo ko ga shi te mo</span></p><p begin="01:04.896" end="01:07.668" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L21">そうまだ終わりそうにない<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">看来还没有结束</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">so u ma da o wa ri so u ni na i</span></p><p begin="01:11.385" end="01:12.501" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L22">彷徨ってる響き<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">彷徨的回响</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">sa ma yo 't te ru hi bi ki</span></p><p begin="01:13.318" end="01:14.652" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L23">きっと呼び戻される<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">一定会被唤回</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ki 't to yo bi mo do sa re ru</span></p><p begin="01:15.537" end="01:18.669" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L24">いわずもがな典型的な罪だ 愛だ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">这是典型的罪孽 爱情</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">i wa zu mo ga na te n ke i te ki na tsu mi da a i da</span></p><p begin="01:19.951" end="01:21.118" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L25">足を踏み入れても<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">即使踏进这里</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">a shi wo fu mi i re te mo</span></p><p begin="01:21.736" end="01:23.085" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L26">本当は知り得ない<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">其实不可能知道</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ho n to u ha shi ri e na i</span></p><p begin="01:23.168" end="01:25.752" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L27">正しい場所に最初から<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">在正确的地方</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ta da shi i ba sho ni</span></p><p begin="01:25.953" end="01:27.470" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L28">留めているから<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">因为从一开始就固定住了</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">sa i sho ka ra to do me te ru ka ra</span></p><p begin="01:28.338" end="01:30.568" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L29">まあ大体これ位だ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">差不多就是这个样子了</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ma a da i ta i ko re ku ra i da</span></p><p begin="01:31.270" end="01:32.835" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L30">愛すべき問題の体裁<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">可爱的问题的形式</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">a i su be ki mo n da i no te i sa i</span></p><p begin="01:32.911" end="01:35.818" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L31">求めて仕方ないんだ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">求之不得</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">mo to me te shi ka ta na i n da</span></p><p begin="01:37.603" end="01:39.085" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L32">変わりなく思ってるよ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我还是这么想的</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ka wa ri na ku o mo 't te ru yo</span></p><p begin="01:39.134" end="01:41.136" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L33">借りてきた言葉だって<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">借来的词</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ka ri te ki ta ko to ba da 't te</span></p><p begin="01:41.852" end="01:43.368" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L34">何度も繰り返すよ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">再重复几次</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">na n do mo ku ri ka e su yo</span></p><p begin="01:43.770" end="01:45.353" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L35">振り切って乗っかって<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">甩开他们 乘胜追击</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">fu ri ki 't te no 'k ka 't te</span></p><p begin="01:46.085" end="01:47.368" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L36">妬みを淘汰して<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">消除嫉妒</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ne ta mi wo to u ta shi te</span></p><p begin="01:48.336" end="01:49.718" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L37">真っ当な動機なら<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">如果动机是正确的</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ma 't to u na do u ki na ra</span></p><p begin="01:49.798" end="01:52.036" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L38">それを分かち合おう<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">让我们来分享吧</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">so re wo wa ka chi a o u</span></p><p begin="01:52.735" end="01:53.719" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L39">碧に躊躇う陽<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">踌躇碧阳</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">a o ni ta me ra u hi</span></p><p begin="01:54.585" end="01:56.003" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L40">縺れ合うのは思惑<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">纠结于纠结的是什么</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">mo tsu re a u no ha o mo wa ku</span></p><p begin="01:56.068" end="02:00.418" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L41">慰めを見出して少し馴染んだ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">感到安慰 有点熟悉了</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">na gu sa me wo mi da shi te su ko shi na ji n da</span></p><p begin="02:01.269" end="02:03.419" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L42">ならば踊るだけ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">那就跳舞吧</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">na ra ba o do ru da ke</span></p><p begin="02:04.485" end="02:05.837" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L43">思いのまま<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">随心所欲</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">o mo i no ma ma</span></p><p begin="02:07.375" end="02:09.885" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L44">曇り解いて遣り過ごすの<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">解开阴霾 度过这一天</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ku mo ri to i te ya ri su go su no</span></p><p begin="02:11.301" end="02:13.868" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L45">スルスルと導かれて<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">这样一来 被引导着</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">su ru su ru to mi chi bi ka re te</span></p><p begin="02:14.031" end="02:18.585" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L46">振り返っても変わりはないから<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">回首依旧如是</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">fu ri ka e 't te mo ka wa ri ha na i ka ra</span></p><p begin="02:19.768" end="02:22.337" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L47">その瞬間見失ったりしない<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">那个瞬间不会迷失</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">so no shu n ka n mi u shi na 't ta ri shi na i</span></p><p begin="02:24.251" end="02:25.451" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L48">振り切って乗っかって<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">甩开他们 乘胜追击</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">fu ri ki 't te no 'k ka 't te</span></p><p begin="02:26.218" end="02:27.319" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L49">上手く惑わせて<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">很好地迷惑</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">u ma ku ma do wa se te</span></p><p begin="02:28.318" end="02:29.452" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L50">心鳴らす音<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">心灵震动的声音</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ko ko ro na ra su o to</span></p><p begin="02:29.725" end="02:31.769" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L51">真っ盛り伝えよう<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">热烈地传达吧</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ma 's sa ka ri tsu ta e yo u</span></p><p begin="02:32.769" end="02:33.736" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L52">藍に躊躇う橙<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">踌躇于蓝的日子</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">a i ni ta me ra u hi</span></p><p begin="02:33.989" end="02:35.735" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L53">惜しみなくもたらす<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">不惜代价</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">o shi mi na ku mo ta ra su</span></p><p begin="02:35.872" end="02:40.251" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L54">覆いを溶かすほど消えてしまうよ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">消失得几乎要融化覆盖层</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">o o i wo to ka su ho do ki e te shi ma u yo</span></p><p begin="02:41.219" end="02:43.602" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L55">実を焦がしても<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">即使焦急万分</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">mi wo ko ga shi te mo</span></p><p begin="02:43.759" end="02:46.669" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L56">そうまだ終わりそうにない<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">看来还没有结束</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">so u ma da o wa ri so u ni na i</span></p></div></body></tt>